4. Akai LPD8 mk2 pad LED protocol
----------------------------------
The optional pad-LED feedback for the Akai LPD8 mk2 sends MIDI SysEx
messages whose byte layout was worked out by third parties, not documented
by Akai:

  https://github.com/john-kuan/lpd8mk2sysex

SoloTone contains its own implementation; no code from that project is
included. Akai Professional and LPD8 are trademarks of their owners; this
project is not affiliated with or endorsed by them.


